        <item>
            <title>1.0.36</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Dark mode reading.</strong> Newsletters, calendar invites and other designed emails are no longer hard to read in dark mode, and your own messages and replies keep the dark look with readable signatures.</li>
<li><strong>Fewer false "codes".</strong> Emails with addresses, phone numbers or order numbers no longer show a verification code that isn't there.</li>
<li><strong>Calendar invites</strong> no longer list the invite file twice.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
