            <title>1.0.35</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>A cleaner What's New.</strong> This window has a new look, with earlier updates tucked away under Earlier updates.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Menu bar icon.</strong> The unread count now has proper spacing next to the envelope.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
