            <title>1.0.34</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Faster address suggestions.</strong> Typing a recipient no longer slows the app down, and you can keep typing or deleting while suggestions are showing. Use ↑/↓ and Return to pick one, or Esc to dismiss.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
